 "final_passage": "Across the five tabular benchmarks, Fernwood achieved a slightly higher mean test AUROC (80.6) than Quillgate-GBDT (80.3), though no significance test was reported for this comparison. Per benchmark, Fernwood outperformed Quillgate-GBDT on Alder-Credit (82.1 vs 80.4), Birchfield-Churn (87.3 vs 86.0), and Edgerton-Default (70.2 vs 67.8), but underperformed on Cobalt-Insure (72.1 vs 73.9) and Dunmore-Fraud (91.1 vs 93.5). Fernwood also achieved a higher mean AUROC than Mesh-MLP (80.6 vs 78.3) and outperformed Mesh-MLP on all five benchmarks individually, again without reported significance tests.",
